        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop&quot; is a game where you spend a short time exploring while waiting for the bus.</strong><br>Walk through the forest, talk to the locals, and you may encounter mysterious events along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dozing off on the bus, you find yourself getting off at an unfamiliar stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the quietly standing &quot;Yorunomori Bus Stop,&quot; in the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While waiting for the next bus, you might talk to someone, examine curious spots, or even ride a swing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Such small actions become &quot;points,&quot; and when you reach 60 points, the bus will arrive and the game will end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough is short, but the events and experiences you encounter will change depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come and visit the Yorunomori Bus Stop again and again.</p>",
